 "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/158350f86d7543cf.png\" alt=\"The map shows the interstates in the United States. The interstates are more spread out in the West and South regions and more crowded in the Northeast.\">\n<figcaption>This map shows the Dwight D. Eisenhower System of Interstate and Defense Highways.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the map provided.</i></p>",
